  "details": "With the new memory limits, I'm seeing many more fallbacks than usual, this is a good thing! However, sometimes I get confused and cannot tell when a player is using a fallback, and whether or not I need to show their avatar. I cannot tell you how many times I found myself clipping into a giant cat avatar over the weekend, only to discover the player was just using an unoptimized model.\n\nAlong with this, it would be good to know when players are viewing *you* as a fallback as well, just so we can be more aware of our surroundings.",
